                <head>Agreement between the United States, France, the Netherlands, and the United
                    Kingdom for the establishment of the Caribbean Commission</head>
                <p>[The Agreement was opened for signature at Washington October 30, 1946, and
                    entered into force August 6, 1948. For text see Department of State, Treaties
                    and Other International Acts Series No. 1799, or 62 Stat. (pt. 3) 2618.]</p>
